t to look for true Kony and  legislation or regulation but to look at  a way of working with these people to  ensure that we provide the best possible  standard we can and to protect cultural  heritage from entering the United  Kingdom we're also working with a number  of working groups to assist the police  and the military in the UK wherever we  can but today the most important thing  is that we learn from you all we have an  excellent program prepared for Stefan  thank you  and I must apologize for being not as  involved in the preparation of today's  conference as I should have been as  co-host so I apologize for that Stefan  but  done an amazing job without without our  assistance in that way I don't want to  take any for any further time we want to  give as much time as possible to to our  speakers I hope that you all today will  find something inspiring to take back  and to assist you in fighting the good  fight to protect cultural heritage from  whatever threats it may face and that we  all leave here today a little bit better  connected and a little bit more  understanding of which each other can do  and what all of us can offer thank you

